ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Odio la primavera con todas mis
fuerzas! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Encima, en {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}}
tengo un montón de alergia. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:001E:}}¡Achús!
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Así no se puede vivir, en serio.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
No gano para pañuelos, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Por eso he decidido mudarme. {{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Jo, pensaba que te ibas a tirar a mis
pies para suplicarme que me quede.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aunque puede que no lo merezca.
Tampoco he sido el mejor vecino
del pueblo. En fin, solo quiero avisar
de que me piro el {{TAG:0004:000F:00CD}} de este mes.{{TAG:0008:0000:0B0028000F001500}}
¡No, hombre!
Que te vaya bonito

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Uau, se lo pensi sul serio.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
forse non dovrei andarmene!?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Bene, allora rimango, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Da oggi sarò il tuo migliore amico,
OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Sarà bellissimo, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Du willst wirklich, dass ich bleibe?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Vielleicht ziehe ich doch nicht weg!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ja, ich bleibe hier, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wir sollten ab jetzt noch bessere
Freunde werden.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich gebe jedenfalls
mein Bestes, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Vay, madem BU kadar önemsiyorsun.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
Belki taşınmamalıyım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Evet, kasabada kalıyorum, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Daha iyi arkadaş olmaya çalışalım, tamam mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ben kendi payıma
çalışacağım, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¿De verdad quieres que me quede?{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Me sorprendes, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}. Nunca
pensé que te importara tanto.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Menudo subidón de moral! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Me has convencido,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}},
¡cancelo la mudanza!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}What, you think I should stay?
But, wait.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} Really? {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}You're not just
saying that, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I wasn't sure you'd even miss me.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Wow, I'm so glad I talked to you.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Because now I'm staying!
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I'm getting sort of choked up by all
this, so that's all I'm going to say,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}. {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Anyway, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}thanks.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's been good being your neighbor.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
We've still got some time together,
so let's make it count, all right?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ha sido todo un placer conocerte.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Aún me quedan unos días por aquí,
así que pásate a verme, ¿vale?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È stato bello essere vicini di casa.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ho ancora qualche giorno prima
della partenza. Vieni a trovarmi!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}War schön, dein Nachbar zu sein.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ein bisschen Zeit haben wir ja noch,
also sollten wir sie nutzen!
